      "scope": "Selected GPU source and headers; not a complete, buildable Linux kernel tree.",
      "pruned_headers": {
        "common_linux": 5217,
        "amd": 53,
        "method": "Conservative literal include closure across every retained AMD/Intel implementation, all AMD headers reachable from those implementations, all x86 architecture headers, asm-generic headers and compiler/linkage/export headers. All preprocessor branches are followed; matching AMD header basenames are retained conservatively. Unreferenced headers are removed; no GPU generation is excluded.",
